  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.welcome.body": "This is where you place and style your HUDs. Here's a quick tour of the basics.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.adding.title": "Add HUDs",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.adding.body": "Click a HUD in the library to drop it in the middle of the screen, or drag it to where you want it. Most HUDs can be added more than once, each with its own settings.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.dragging.title": "Move and resize",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.dragging.body": "Drag a HUD to move it. It snaps to the screen edges and other HUDs. Hold Alt to place it freely. Drag a corner to resize it. Drag across empty space to select several HUDs at once.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.merging.title": "Merge HUDs",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.merging.body": "Stack HUDs on top of each other, or put them side by side, and their backgrounds merge into one shape. Drag any of them to move the merged HUDs together. To pull one out, click it first, then drag it away.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.merging.task": "Try it: stack a HUD right above or below another one until their backgrounds merge.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.merging.task_add": "Try it: add another text HUD from the library, then stack it right above or below the first one.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.merging.task_done": "Nice, their backgrounds merged.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.anchoring.title": "Anchor HUDs",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.anchoring.body": "Right-click a HUD to open this menu, then pick Anchor. Click a point on your HUD, then a point on another HUD. It will now follow that HUD wherever it moves.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.settings.title": "Settings",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.settings.body": "Click a HUD to open this panel. The Settings tab holds the HUD's own options and where it shows up.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.style.title": "Style",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.style.body": "The Style tab changes how the HUD looks: its text, colours, shadow and background, including merging.",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.fonts.title": "Fonts and text",
  "aetherconfig.hud.tour.fonts.body": "In Style, the Text section lets you switch between the Minecraft and Poppins fonts, and change the size, weight, style and case.",
